Description: Contains the methods proposed by Geyer and Meeden (2005) 
  <doi:10.1214/088342305000000340> and Trigo et al. (2025) 
  <doi:10.47749/T/UNICAMP.2025.1500297> to construct fuzzy
  confidence intervals. Compute and plot the fuzzy membership
  functions of the methods, and the expected length compared
  with the infimum.
